Enjoy our absolutely new 2 in 1 app! Color your screen with beautiful HD wallpapers and customize your device ringtones! It’s a great opportunity for you to give your device a completely fresh look and new sound!

Main features of Ringtones App:
– Ringtones Library – includes more than 1000 unique music ringtones for any taste and mood, sorted into 32 categories with such music genres as: Classical, Electronic, Rock, etc;
– Wallpapers Gallery – includes more than 1500 beautiful HD wallpapers and themes for any taste and mood, sorted into 30 categories, such as: Animals, Music, Nature, etc;
– Audio Recorder – record your own voice, songs or any other sounds you want to create your own ringtones from them;
– Ringtone Maker – create your own ringtone, text tone, voicemail, mail, calendar and reminder alerts from our music ringtones library or your own records from our Audio Recorder!
– My Ringtones – edit your saved ringtones, records, text tones and alerts or listen to them without internet or wifi connection.

Make your device absolutely unique with the help of our app. Add a new sound and fresh look to it.

What you will get with Ringtones App:
– 1000+ unique ringtones library with the cool ringtones for any taste and mood (160 for Free);
– 1500+ HD wallpapers and themes for any taste and color (150 for Free);
– Audio Recorder – allows you to record your own voice, songs or any sounds you want, then create a great ringtones from them.
– Ringtone Maker – allows you to make your own ringtone from our music ringtones library or from your records in Audio Recorder;
– My Ringtones – allows you to edit your saved ringtones or listen to them without internet or wifi connection;
– Daily new ringtones and wallpapers updates;
– No ads!

How to use Ringtones App:
– Dive into our beautiful wallpapers gallery to give your screens absolutely fresh look;
– Explore our unique ringtones library to give your device absolutely new sound;
– Record your own voice, songs or any other sounds you want with the help of our Audio Recorder;
– Then create absolutely unique ringtones from your records or from our music ringtones library;
– Set your created ringtones on device with the help of our detailed setup guides;
– Edit all your saved ringtones, text tones and alerts in your “My Ringtones” library;
– Enjoy your updated device with new sound and fresh look!

